option.DYNAMIC_RAIN=Dynamic directional rain
option.DYNAMIC_RAIN.comment=Tilts precipitation with evolving wind and player movement. Turning the camera changes its apparent direction naturally.
option.RAIN_WIND_STRENGTH=Rain wind strength
option.RAIN_WIND_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the horizontal slope of falling rain.
option.RAIN_MOTION_RESPONSE=Movement response
option.RAIN_MOTION_RESPONSE.comment=Controls the extra apparent wind created by player movement.
option.RAIN_OPACITY=Rain visibility
option.RAIN_OPACITY.comment=Controls the opacity of rain streaks without changing snow.
option.RAIN_REFLECTION=Rain mirror highlight
option.RAIN_REFLECTION.comment=Controls the cool reflective highlight inside each rain streak.
option.RAIN_BRIGHTNESS=Rain brightness
option.RAIN_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Brightens reflective rain after scene lighting.
option.RAIN_SSR=Rain screen-space reflections
option.RAIN_SSR.comment=Ray-marches visible rain streaks against the opaque scene for real environment reflections.
option.RAIN_PUDDLES=Dynamic rain puddles
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=Creates procedural puddles on horizontal terrain exposed to the sky.
option.PUDDLE_COVERAGE=Puddle coverage
option.PUDDLE_COVERAGE.comment=Controls the population and scale range of procedural multi-lobed puddles.
option.PUDDLE_REFLECTION=Puddle reflection
option.PUDDLE_REFLECTION.comment=Controls sky, planar environment and SSR reflections while preserving the animated water body.
option.PUDDLE_RIPPLE_STRENGTH=Puddle ripples
option.PUDDLE_RIPPLE_STRENGTH.comment=Controls animated circular ripples from rain impacts.
option.PUDDLE_WATER_MOTION=Puddle water animation
option.PUDDLE_WATER_MOTION.comment=Controls the moving noise, refraction and surface animation inside puddles.
option.PUDDLE_RAIN_RINGS=Raindrop ring texture
option.PUDDLE_RAIN_RINGS.comment=Controls visible animated impact centers, bright rings and dark outer wave edges on puddles.
option.PUDDLE_WIND_WAVES=Rain wind waves
option.PUDDLE_WIND_WAVES.comment=Controls continuous traveling waves that follow the evolving rain direction between individual impacts.
option.PUDDLE_SSR_GLINTS=Puddle scene reflections
option.PUDDLE_SSR_GLINTS.comment=Reflects visible terrain, buildings and entities across animated puddle surfaces.
option.PUDDLE_SSR_STEPS=Weather SSR quality
option.PUDDLE_SSR_STEPS.comment=Ray-march samples used by rain streaks and puddles. Higher values cost more GPU time.
